"*easy* way out"
Since you are way past black dragon redemption you really NEED that 
cockatrice (corpse). Do whatever you can to get close to it and kill it 
(AND get on it's spot to pick up the corpse). Then whack everything IN 
YOUR PATH to stone, except a few monsters you have to to the old-
fashioned way. Depending on HP's you might have to whack a bit more. If 
the corpse rots before you get to the portal, hope you can get another 
one. Oh, and obviously, whack summoning monsters with priority so minor 
detours are just fine :-). Shortcut: wish for a corpse.

"tedious way out"
If you can sustain it, using a ring of conflict and a ring of 
regeneration will help, hopefully enough but probably not if you have 
enough summoning monsters annoying you. Vortexes are your friend for 
regeneration etc.

Minor points. It's probably useless to waste your wands of 
teleportation, death and so forth. Summoning will fill the empty spots 
anyway. Ok, death raying the summoners is not a bad idea but you will 
probably get a few more generated of those while you work your way all 
the way to the other side.


